</span></span></code></pre></td></tr></table>
</div>
</div><hr>
<h3 id="解题思路">解题思路：</h3>
<p>1、观察密文，一眼Base64加密，使用在线工具 <a href="https://www.qqxiuzi.cn/bianma/base64.htm"target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Base64加解密</a> ，得到另一串密文。</p>
<div class="highlight"><div class="chroma">
<table class="lntable"><tr><td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code><span class="lnt">1
</span></code></pre></td>
<td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback"><span class="line"><span class="cl">v)*L*_F0&lt;}@H0&gt;F49023@FE0#@EN
</span></span></code></pre></td></tr></table>
</div>
</div><p>
<div class="post-img-view">
    <a data-fancybox="gallery" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251215172455662.png">
        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251215172455662.png" 
             alt="在这里插入图片描述" 
              
             loading="lazy"
        />
    </a>
</div></p>
<p>2、尝试了很多方法，都没有成功。最后，根据此密文的ASCII码值都处于33 ~ 126范围，确定为ROT47加密。</p>
<p>
<div class="post-img-view">
    <a data-fancybox="gallery" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251215172455663.png">
        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251215172455663.png" 
